    <summary>A free, open-source Monero wallet for desktop.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
Feather Wallet is a free, open-source Monero (XMR) wallet for Windows, macOS, and Linux.

## Features
- **Fast & Lightweight** — Starts up in seconds and uses minimal resources
- **Private by Default** — Built-in Tor support, automatically connects to remote nodes
- **Easy to Use** — Clean, intuitive interface designed for everyday use
- **Full Monero Feature Support** — Subaddresses, accounts, coin control, and more
- **Open Source** — Fully auditable code under the BSD-3-Clause license

## Important: Windows Defender Exclusions
Monero wallets are frequently targeted by antivirus false positives.
This package **automatically** adds Windows Defender exclusions for:
- The Feather Wallet install directory
- The `feather.exe` process
- The Chocolatey download cache (during install only)

These exclusions are **removed automatically** when you uninstall the package.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/feather-wallet/feather/releases/tag/2.8.1</releaseNotes>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency id="vcredist140" version="14.0" />
